1
00:00:00,801 --> 00:00:04,801
...and after you pass the first three barriers,
you kind of wanna take it all the way.

2
00:00:06,056 --> 00:00:09,476
(Penny:)Well, I'm sorry, Leonard.
It's very hard to feel sympathy for you.

3
00:00:09,643 --> 00:00:12,733
Okay. Let me tell you about the first time
I brought a girl over.

4
00:00:12,896 --> 00:00:13,936
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

5
00:00:14,106 --> 00:00:15,566
SHELDON:
Leonard?

6
00:00:16,316 --> 00:00:19,026
(Past Leonard:)Shh. Just pretend we're not here.

7
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,820
[KNOCKING]

8
00:00:20,988 --> 00:00:22,488
SHELDON:
Leonard?

9
00:00:23,615 --> 00:00:25,955
(Past Leonard:)I'm sure he'll go away.

10
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,790
SHELDON: I'm just gonna keep knocking
till you answer.

11
00:00:29,955 --> 00:00:30,955
[KNOCKING]

12
00:00:31,123 --> 00:00:32,163
(Past Sheldon:)Leonard?

13
00:00:32,332 --> 00:00:33,962
Leonard? Leonard?

14
00:00:34,126 --> 00:00:35,506
(Past Leonard:)What do you want?

15
00:00:35,669 --> 00:00:37,749
(Past Leonard:)I didn't say come in.

16
00:00:37,921 --> 00:00:39,961
(Past Sheldon:)You asked what I want.

17
00:00:40,215 --> 00:00:41,255
(Past Sheldon:)I wanted to come in.

18
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:45,257
(Past Sheldon:)I'm here because you violated
our roommate agreement.

19
00:00:45,429 --> 00:00:46,849
(Past Sheldon:)Specifically, section eight...

20
00:00:47,014 --> 00:00:50,854
...visitor's subsection C, females,
paragraph four, coitus.

21
00:00:52,144 --> 00:00:56,444
"Roommates shall give each other
12 hours notice of impending coitus."

22
00:00:56,607 --> 00:00:59,107
(Past Leonard:)I didn't even know her 12 hours ago.

